# Managed by home/srvs/oracle-skills.nix; edits here are overwritten.
#
# ALLOWLIST, and it must stay one. The repo root is ~/.local/share/oracle,
# chatter's whole runtime dir — it also holds `sessions/` (every conversation
# he has had with chatter), `memory/`, `jobs/`, `sandbox/` and `images/`. None
# of that may ever leave the machine. So: ignore everything at the root, then
# re-include exactly the three directories that ARE the shared base. A new store
# landing beside them can therefore never widen what gets pushed; only a
# deliberate edit here can.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/skills/
!/agents/
!/tools/
# Not a store he writes, but the same class of fact: measured KV-cache bytes
# per token, per model. That is a property of the MODEL, so a measurement taken
# on either machine is true on the other — and book cannot take one (the daemon
# is on top), so without this it falls back to a 32k window for every model.
!/ctxfit.json

# Machine-local build products inside a skill. youtube-content builds a ~20 MB
# venv on first use; the skill's own setup block recreates it on the other host.
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
